msgid "Clouds noticeably brighter than the sky."
msgstr "Les nuages visiblement plus lumineux que le ciel."

#: PiFinder/ui/sqm.py:428
msgid "Milky Way invisible near horizon, looks washed out overhead."
msgstr "La Voie Lactée invisible près de l'horizon, semble délavée au zénith."

#: PiFinder/ui/sqm.py:433
msgid "Bright Suburban Sky"
msgstr "Ciel Suburbain Lumineux"

#: PiFinder/ui/sqm.py:437
msgid "The zodiacal light is invisible."
msgstr "La lumière zodiacale est invisible."

#: PiFinder/ui/sqm.py:438
msgid "Light pollution makes sky within 35° of horizon glow grayish white."
msgstr ""
"La pollution lumineuse fait briller le ciel jusqu'à 35° de l'horizon d'un"
